513
01:13:16,225 --> 01:13:18,060
[guns cock]

514
01:13:21,939 --> 01:13:24,025
No, sir.

515
01:13:28,654 --> 01:13:31,866
This person, I'm told,

516
01:13:31,991 --> 01:13:35,369
is actually attempting
to contact the Resistance.

517
01:13:37,830 --> 01:13:40,791
Now, tell me,
if you would be so kind,

518
01:13:40,917 --> 01:13:45,880
how exactly have you been
making use of your time of late?

519
01:13:52,553 --> 01:13:55,264
Attempting to contact
the Resistance, sir.

520
01:14:00,436 --> 01:14:03,648
Attempting?

521
01:14:03,773 --> 01:14:07,568
How is it that you intend
to expose this traitor

522
01:14:07,693 --> 01:14:10,196
if all you do is attempt?

523
01:14:16,369 --> 01:14:21,624
You're absolutely 100% right, sir.

524
01:14:23,417 --> 01:14:25,503
Of course I am.

525
01:14:28,214 --> 01:14:31,258
The Cleric is the final line of defence.

526
01:14:31,384 --> 01:14:36,180
If the Resistance
compromises it, we are doomed.

527
01:14:37,223 --> 01:14:40,309
Father is doomed.

528
01:14:40,434 --> 01:14:44,522
I will redouble my effort, sir,
to locate the Resistance,

529
01:14:44,647 --> 01:14:47,108
to find this traitor

530
01:14:47,233 --> 01:14:50,653
