542
01:16:24,288 --> 01:16:27,416
<i>[bleeping]</i>

543
01:16:40,179 --> 01:16:42,681
Aren't you going to dose?

544
01:16:56,028 --> 01:16:57,446
My God.

545
01:16:59,949 --> 01:17:02,034
What...

546
01:17:03,536 --> 01:17:05,621
