547
01:17:07,456 --> 01:17:08,874
I don't know.

548
01:17:43,492 --> 01:17:47,788
- Fifty sweepers, maybe more.
- What about an audience?

549
01:17:47,913 --> 01:17:50,916
Father's never given a single
audience since the upheaval.

550
01:17:51,041 --> 01:17:53,419
