to fight these kind of odds.

551
01:17:53,544 --> 01:17:56,005
Even if I could...

552
01:17:56,172 --> 01:17:59,049
Even if I could make it through,
what guarantee is there

553
01:17:59,175 --> 01:18:02,261
it would accomplish anything,
anything would be different?

554
01:18:02,386 --> 01:18:04,597
Our network is larger
than you could imagine.

555
01:18:04,722 --> 01:18:07,933
The instant word comes
that Father is dead,

556
01:18:08,058 --> 01:18:12,479
