clinics and factories.

557
01:18:12,646 --> 01:18:16,066
If we can succeed in disrupting
the supply for even one day,

558
01:18:16,192 --> 01:18:20,696
one day, our cause will be won
by human nature itself.

559
01:18:20,863 --> 01:18:23,574
What about war? There would be
cruelties that are gone.

560
01:18:23,699 --> 01:18:26,869
Replaced by the Tetragrammaton?

561
01:18:29,330 --> 01:18:31,415
Will you do it?

562
01:18:39,757 --> 01:18:41,425
Yes.

563
01:18:43,427 --> 01:18:45,554
Can you?

564
01:18:48,224 --> 01:18:50,309
I don't know.

565
01:19:00,444 --> 01:19:05,741
Don't... Seeing her one last time
will only make it harder

566
01:19:05,908 --> 01:19:07,993
to do what you have to do.

567
01:19:54,290 --> 01:19:56,375
File footage.

568
01:19:59,336 --> 01:20:03,257
Viviana Preston.
Sentence and incineration.

569
01:20:06,802 --> 01:20:08,804
- Auditory.
<i>- Viviana Preston,</i>

570
01:20:08,929 --> 01:20:11,473
<i>for ceasing your interval,
for the crime of feeling,</i>

571
01:20:11,640 --> 01:20:14,810
<i>you will suffer annihilation
in the city furnaces.</i>

572
01:20:14,977 --> 01:20:18,105
<i>You will be taken there
immediately and you will burn.</i>

573
01:21:28,258 --> 01:21:30,010
Has the incineration gone through?

574
01:21:30,135 --> 01:21:33,055
It's going through now. Hey!

575
01:22:01,708 --> 01:22:06,088
<i>Machine turbines priming.
Machine turbines priming.</i>

576
01:22:06,255 --> 01:22:08,882
- I need to speak to this woman.
- You're too late.

577
01:22:09,007 --> 01:22:10,926
If we force the door now,

578
01:22:11,093 --> 01:22:13,387
