at street level.

579
01:22:13,512 --> 01:22:15,931
<i>...clear the area immediately.</i>

580
01:22:16,056 --> 01:22:20,227
<i>All unauthorized personnel,
clear the area immediately.</i>

581
01:22:20,352 --> 01:22:23,397
<i>Turbines primed.</i>

582
01:22:23,522 --> 01:22:26,775
<i>Fire in ten seconds,</i>

583
01:22:26,900 --> 01:22:29,820
<i>nine seconds, eight seconds,</i>

584
01:22:29,987 --> 01:22:33,073
<i>seven seconds, six seconds,</i>

585
01:22:33,240 --> 01:22:36,535
<i>five seconds, four seconds,</i>

586
01:22:36,660 --> 01:22:39,538
<i>three seconds, two seconds...</i>

587
01:22:41,415 --> 01:22:44,001
<i>Turbines... fire.</i>

588
01:23:35,010 --> 01:23:37,095
Cleric John Preston.

589
01:23:43,727 --> 01:23:45,854
You are under arrest.

590
01:23:47,523 --> 01:23:51,485
This man, this senior cleric,

591
01:23:51,610 --> 01:23:54,363
has ceased the dose.

592
01:23:54,530 --> 01:23:57,324
He is feeling.

593
01:23:57,449 --> 01:24:01,078
He is the worm
that has been eating at the core

594
01:24:01,203 --> 01:24:04,206
of our great society.

595
01:24:04,331 --> 01:24:08,877
And I... I have brought him
for your justice.

596
01:24:13,632 --> 01:24:17,261
I told you I'd make my career
with you, Preston.

597
01:24:19,137 --> 01:24:22,057
Vice-Council, this man is guilty

598
01:24:22,182 --> 01:24:24,184
of consorting with sense offenders,

599
01:24:24,309 --> 01:24:27,271
of having relations with a female,

600
01:24:27,396 --> 01:24:30,607
of sense crime itself.

601
01:24:30,732 --> 01:24:33,735
Dispatch a team to his quarters
to search for unused Prozium.

602
01:24:33,902 --> 01:24:37,573
If you'll run the trace record
on his sidearm,

603
01:24:37,739 --> 01:24:40,242
