with the Resistance,

610
01:25:10,105 --> 01:25:13,567
even becoming a champion
in its Underground.

611
01:25:13,692 --> 01:25:15,777
But it's true.

612
01:25:19,948 --> 01:25:23,994
I promised
I would bring you that man.

613
01:25:24,119 --> 01:25:26,204
And I have.

614
01:25:28,624 --> 01:25:30,584
- Cleric Brandt.
- Sir.

615
01:25:30,709 --> 01:25:33,128
The trace shows
that it was your gun

616
01:25:33,295 --> 01:25:35,839
