617
01:25:35,964 --> 01:25:38,467
That's impossible.

618
01:25:42,721 --> 01:25:45,057
This is wrong.

619
01:25:45,724 --> 01:25:50,103
<i>I think, in the end,
it'll be better if you have it.</i>

620
01:25:51,855 --> 01:25:57,069
He switched them.
See, I have his gun now.

621
01:25:57,194 --> 01:26:00,238
Of course you do. You took it
when you arrested me.

622
01:26:00,364 --> 01:26:02,032
What?

623
01:26:02,157 --> 01:26:05,327
Take him to the Hall
of Destruction for combustion.

624
01:26:05,452 --> 01:26:08,830
Wait, wait, wait, wait!
I can explain this.

625
01:26:08,955 --> 01:26:13,835
I'm not feeling.
He is the one who's feeling.

626
01:26:13,960 --> 01:26:17,506
This is a mistake.

627
01:26:17,631 --> 01:26:22,761
Of course, since a complaint
has been lodged,

628
01:26:22,886 --> 01:26:25,305
law and the letter
is that I allow a team

629
01:26:25,430 --> 01:26:28,350
