is going to his end?

635
01:26:44,658 --> 01:26:47,369
The only thing that disturbs me,
sir, is that

636
01:26:47,536 --> 01:26:51,581
I am Father's instrument against
the Underground, and yet...

637
01:26:51,707 --> 01:26:54,584
I've never had the honour
of meeting him.

638
01:26:57,212 --> 01:27:01,550
