654
01:29:31,032 --> 01:29:33,910
Do not address Father
unless first addressed by him.

655
01:29:34,035 --> 01:29:35,704
Avoid eye contact.

656
01:29:35,871 --> 01:29:38,582
If you should break
his personal security zone,

657
01:29:38,707 --> 01:29:42,669
