from a Grammaton Cleric?

671
01:30:58,161 --> 01:31:00,288
You ask him for it.

672
01:31:07,796 --> 01:31:11,633
I told you I'd make
my career with you, Cleric.

673
01:31:17,138 --> 01:31:21,101
<i>Preston. Brandt's job was simple.</i>

674
01:31:21,267 --> 01:31:24,229
<i>To make you feel like you'd won,</i>

675
01:31:24,396 --> 01:31:26,439
<i>to make you feel safe.</i>

676
01:31:30,068 --> 01:31:33,405
<i>For years,
I tried to infiltrate an agent</i>

677
01:31:33,530 --> 01:31:36,324
<i>into the Underground,</i>

678
01:31:36,491 --> 01:31:38,827
<i>until it hit me.</i>

679
01:31:38,994 --> 01:31:42,747
<i>In order to pass undetected
into their midst,</i>

680
01:31:42,872 --> 01:31:44,833
<i>in order to be trusted by them,</i>

681
01:31:45,000 --> 01:31:49,212
<i>my provocateur
would have to think like them,</i>

682
01:31:51,047 --> 01:31:53,550
<i>and would have to feel like them.</i>

683
01:31:53,717 --> 01:31:56,845
<i>But where to find such a man?</i>

684
01:31:57,012 --> 01:32:01,641
<i>A man with the capacity to feel
who didn't yet know it.</i>

685
01:32:04,853 --> 01:32:09,190
But... we've never met.

686
01:32:09,357 --> 01:32:11,401
<i>No?</i>

687
