<i>Don't look so surprised.
Why should Father be more real</i>

688
01:32:20,035 --> 01:32:22,662
<i>than any other political puppet?</i>

689
01:32:22,787 --> 01:32:26,041
<i>The real Father died years ago.</i>

690
01:32:26,207 --> 01:32:30,670
<i>The Council elected me
to pursue his paternal tradition.</i>

691
01:32:30,795 --> 01:32:33,173
<i>And you, Preston,</i>

692
01:32:33,298 --> 01:32:36,092
<i>the supposed saviour
of the Resistance,</i>

693
01:32:36,217 --> 01:32:38,178
<i>are now its destroyer.</i>

694
01:32:38,303 --> 01:32:41,723
<i>And along with them
you've given me yourself.</i>

695
01:32:42,807 --> 01:32:47,145
<i>Calmly. Coolly.</i>

696
01:32:47,270 --> 01:32:50,940
<i>Entirely without incident.</i>

697
01:32:55,612 --> 01:32:56,613
No.

698
01:32:56,738 --> 01:32:59,240
<i>- [long bleep]</i>
- Oh.

699
01:33:00,742 --> 01:33:03,286
Shit.

700
01:33:03,411 --> 01:33:05,580
Not without incident.

701
01:33:12,420 --> 01:33:14,923
I'm coming.

702
01:34:43,011 --> 01:34:46,389
You really should learn to knock.

703
01:35:11,831 --> 01:35:14,125
How did it feel, Preston?

704
01:35:22,217 --> 01:35:24,510
[growls]

705
01:35:55,333 --> 01:35:57,710
Mind the uniform, Cleric.

706
01:36:03,508 --> 01:36:06,469
I plan to be wearing it
for a long time.

707
01:36:42,672 --> 01:36:47,427
Be careful, Preston.
You're treading on my dreams.

708
01:37:22,503 --> 01:37:23,838
No!

709
01:37:25,173 --> 01:37:27,508
Wait! Wait!

710
01:37:27,675 --> 01:37:30,178
Look at me. Look at me.

711
01:37:32,430 --> 01:37:36,851
I'm life. I live, I breathe.

712
01:37:39,354 --> 01:37:40,355
I feel.

713
01:37:43,232 --> 01:37:46,694
Now that you know it,
can you really take it?

714
01:37:48,488 --> 01:37:50,990
Is it really worth the price?

715
01:37:56,537 --> 01:37:59,040
I pay it gladly.

716
01:38:17,308 --> 01:38:21,562
<i>The following items have been
rated EC-10 Condemned.</i>

717
01:38:43,292 --> 01:38:45,878
<i>...conquest of the known world,
Alexander the Great</i>

718
01:38:46,003 --> 01:38:48,881
